WEBVTT

00:03.870 --> 00:06.810
<b>Oh-ho… It's great to see your enthusiasm,</b>

00:06.810 --> 00:10.400
<b>but you won't be able to even scratch me
with that dull blade.</b>

00:11.900 --> 00:13.320
<b>Do it, Sakurama!</b>

00:13.320 --> 00:16.660
<b>Have a taste of the gadget
made by the cadet you killed!</b>

00:16.930 --> 00:18.680
<b>Burst Form!</b>

00:24.080 --> 00:26.000
<b>Go! Go! Loser Ranger!</b>

01:54.050 --> 01:56.070
<b>That form's overpowered!</b>

01:56.070 --> 01:58.280
<b>Even a boss monster
wouldn't escape unscathed!</b>

01:58.280 --> 01:59.680
<b>You mustn't let your guard down.</b>

02:03.860 --> 02:05.030
<b>Sakurama!</b>

02:05.950 --> 02:07.040
<b>Are you all right?</b>

02:07.040 --> 02:09.210
<b>No way. How are they still alive?</b>

02:09.210 --> 02:11.880
<b>Crap! They escaped by a hair's breadth!</b>

02:11.880 --> 02:15.940
<b>So you truly intend to betray us, D.</b>

02:15.940 --> 02:19.950
<b>I've never seen that form before.
Let me take a look.</b>

02:19.950 --> 02:21.660
<b>Yikes! Here you go!
 Woah!</b>

02:21.660 --> 02:22.910
<b>Huh?</b>

02:28.050 --> 02:30.750
<b>Sakurama! It's dangerous
to do that out of nowhere!</b>

02:30.750 --> 02:33.210
<b>Never mind that!
Please keep passing it around!</b>

02:33.210 --> 02:36.150
<b>Their laser takes time
to charge! Anyone will do.</b>

02:36.150 --> 02:38.880
<b>The one that manages to get
within close range will finish them off!</b>

02:38.880 --> 02:41.890
<b>What a reckless and naive plan.</b>

02:41.890 --> 02:43.010
<b>I'm in!</b>

02:45.030 --> 02:47.890
<b>Hey! I didn't agree to this…</b>

02:47.890 --> 02:51.480
<b>Yukino! You have to get closer!</b>

02:51.480 --> 02:53.560
<b>As if I can, stupid! Die!</b>

02:55.750 --> 02:57.090
<b>Sakurama!</b>

03:01.630 --> 03:03.030
<b>I knew it wouldn't work!</b>

03:04.240 --> 03:05.390
<b>What?</b>

03:06.010 --> 03:07.390
<b>Yukino! One-two!</b>

03:07.390 --> 03:09.620
<b>Let's go!</b>

03:09.620 --> 03:11.420
<b>Jeez. Okay, fine!</b>

03:12.960 --> 03:14.840
<b>Here you go!</b>

03:17.510 --> 03:18.630
<b>Do it!</b>

03:24.220 --> 03:26.030
<b><i>These guys are amazing!</i></b>

03:26.030 --> 03:28.660
<b><i>No wonder they managed
to survive as cadets!</i></b>

03:29.730 --> 03:31.460
<b>This is the end, boss monster!</b>

03:31.460 --> 03:34.060
<b>It's time you learn
how superior we humans are!</b>

03:34.060 --> 03:35.980
<b>Go to hell, you damn bastard!</b>

03:35.980 --> 03:37.980
<b>I'll start with you first.</b>

03:39.360 --> 03:40.800
<b>Above you, Yukino!</b>

03:40.800 --> 03:43.010
<b>Woah!</b>

03:45.120 --> 03:47.290
<b>What…</b>

03:52.550 --> 03:54.130
<b>I-Ishikawa!</b>

03:54.130 --> 03:55.130
<b>Get away!</b>

03:58.170 --> 04:01.170
<b><i>Damn it,
I forgot that the clones exist…</i></b>

04:01.170 --> 04:02.860
<b>You're trembling.</b>

04:02.860 --> 04:07.100
<b>No need to worry,
everyone's going to the same place as you.</b>

04:11.520 --> 04:14.540
<b>All right! Four more left now!</b>

04:14.540 --> 04:16.440
<b>Don't let your guard down yet, Tokita!</b>

04:19.690 --> 04:22.700
<b>You moron… Nadeshiko!</b>

04:22.700 --> 04:27.700
<b>As you wish. Lovely! Hearty!</b>

04:27.700 --> 04:28.970
<b>Panacea!</b>

04:33.250 --> 04:36.170
<b>Recovery?
No, that's regeneration.</b>

04:36.170 --> 04:38.630
<b>Help me out, Suzukiri!</b>

04:38.630 --> 04:41.940
<b>Roger. Beep! Fast-Forward.</b>

04:49.030 --> 04:53.770
<b>To think that a mere Junior First Rank
can come this far. Interesting!</b>

04:54.570 --> 04:59.960
<b>I shall bury you with all of my power!</b>

05:01.400 --> 05:04.700
<b>Looks like they're finally
getting motivated. In that case…</b>

05:04.700 --> 05:06.860
<b>Tokita! Give them
one big blast as a greeting!</b>

05:06.860 --> 05:09.260
<b>Jeez, don't order me around.</b>

05:17.760 --> 05:20.190
<b>Where are you aiming…</b>

05:20.800 --> 05:23.510
<b>Beep. Pause.</b>

05:26.010 --> 05:28.800
<b>She stopped her own ally's attack?</b>

05:29.480 --> 05:30.640
<b>I'm digging in.</b>

05:42.580 --> 05:45.820
<b>I can't eat any more.
I'm leaving the rest to you!</b>

05:46.630 --> 05:48.800
<b>Then, these fire dragons…</b>

05:48.800 --> 05:50.220
<b>It's a barricade.</b>

05:50.220 --> 05:52.830
<b>We wouldn't want you
to destroy this place any further.</b>

05:53.260 --> 05:54.700
<b>I'm counting on you, old man!</b>

05:55.450 --> 06:01.630
<b>Lovely! Hearty! Full Swing!</b>

06:11.070 --> 06:12.810
<b>That was too much!
</b>

06:14.200 --> 06:16.850
<b>That defeated
the purpose of putting up a barricade!</b>

06:17.450 --> 06:20.270
<b>That was an opponent I could not afford
to go easy on, after all.</b>

06:20.270 --> 06:22.710
<b>We should have taken care of most of them.</b>

06:22.710 --> 06:24.280
<b><i>Now then…</i></b>

06:24.280 --> 06:29.530
<b><i>I can't help you out openly,
but I can at least let one of you escape.</i></b>

06:29.530 --> 06:32.030
<b>To think that there's a survivor…</b>

06:32.030 --> 06:35.200
<b><i>It's a given
that she would detest the Rangers.</i></b>

06:40.210 --> 06:44.560
<b>Divine Artifact, Manifest.
Pink Dragon Naga!</b>

06:49.720 --> 06:52.820
<b><i>My way of thanking you for
what you did to my parents and my legs,</i></b>

06:52.820 --> 06:54.410
<b><i>boss monster Peltrola.</i></b>

07:00.410 --> 07:03.040
<b>Reporting in, Pink Keeper!</b>

07:03.040 --> 07:05.610
<b>It appears that we have
multiple casualties underground.</b>

07:05.610 --> 07:07.320
<b>I'm worried.</b>

07:07.320 --> 07:10.240
<b>Blue's Junior First Rank survived,</b>

07:10.240 --> 07:12.590
<b>but other members of the Blue Squadron
have lost their lives--</b>

07:12.590 --> 07:14.740
<b>I couldn't care less about those trash.</b>

07:14.740 --> 07:15.760
<b>I'm sorry?</b>

07:15.760 --> 07:17.510
<b>Why isn't it connecting?</b>

07:18.540 --> 07:21.500
<b>Hibiki… Please stay safe!</b>

07:21.500 --> 07:24.600
<b><i>Peltrola… You're pathetic.</i></b>

07:25.020 --> 07:27.510
<b><i>You abandoned the fortress
and your subordinates,</i></b>

07:27.510 --> 07:30.280
<b><i>and even resorted to
such underhanded means…</i></b>

07:30.280 --> 07:34.010
<b><i>Is this how a boss monster,
who stands above us, is supposed to act?</i></b>

07:35.150 --> 07:36.240
<b>Let me go!</b>

07:36.240 --> 07:38.450
<b>If you're planning to use me as a hostage,
then too bad!</b>

07:38.450 --> 07:40.020
<b>I won't be your shield!</b>

07:40.020 --> 07:43.020
<b>We're not here to make friends!</b>

07:43.020 --> 07:45.880
<b>Is that so? In that case…
</b>

07:45.880 --> 07:47.530
<b>Please wait!</b>

07:47.960 --> 07:49.280
<b>Hmm?</b>

07:49.710 --> 07:51.150
<b>We surrender.</b>

07:51.150 --> 07:52.260
<b>What?</b>

07:54.460 --> 07:55.800
<b>Let's throw away the gadgets.</b>

07:55.800 --> 07:57.220
<b>Are you serious, Sakurama?</b>

07:57.220 --> 08:01.390
<b>I'm sure you understand what our priority
should be at this moment.</b>

08:03.470 --> 08:05.060
<b>Yeah, you're right.</b>

08:06.540 --> 08:08.050
<b><i>I don't get it myself either.</i></b>

08:08.690 --> 08:10.550
<b><i>Before I met you guys…</i></b>

08:10.550 --> 08:13.570
<b><i>Would I have done the same thing
before I came here?</i></b>

08:14.320 --> 08:15.570
<b>Hold up!</b>

08:15.570 --> 08:17.660
<b>If we throw away our weapons
before a boss monster,</b>

08:17.660 --> 08:19.620
<b>there's no way we're not getting killed!</b>

08:19.620 --> 08:21.060
<b>I see…</b>

08:21.060 --> 08:23.540
<b>Sorry,
but I'm not going along with that!</b>

08:23.540 --> 08:26.380
<b>Akebayashi! Are you escaping by yourself?</b>

08:26.380 --> 08:30.360
<b>We don't have a choice.
Urabe and Shion, please hand them over.</b>

08:30.360 --> 08:33.130
<b>No way! I'm doing this even if I'm alone!</b>

08:33.130 --> 08:35.220
<b>Otherwise, Ranmaru wouldn't be able
to rest in peace!</b>

08:35.220 --> 08:36.370
<b>Calm down.</b>

08:37.420 --> 08:39.970
<b>Sakurama. Are you sure about this?</b>

08:39.970 --> 08:41.120
<b>Yes.</b>

08:43.510 --> 08:45.180
<b>Damn it!</b>

08:47.880 --> 08:50.880
<b>Please let us go with this,
boss monster.</b>

08:50.880 --> 08:53.880
<b>That's rather decisive of you.</b>

08:53.880 --> 08:57.390
<b>You think I'll back down with just this?</b>

08:57.390 --> 09:00.390
<b>If you don't,
we'll just fight until we die.</b>

09:00.390 --> 09:02.490
<b>That's ridiculous, don't you think?</b>

09:11.480 --> 09:15.050
<b>Go, that pipe leads to the surface!</b>

09:15.050 --> 09:17.010
<b>There is no need to lament.</b>

09:17.010 --> 09:19.930
<b>The fact that you stopped fighting
is a huge improvement.</b>

09:19.930 --> 09:22.270
<b>Once we've conquered this world,</b>

09:22.270 --> 09:27.100
<b>we shall take good care of
you foolish surface-dwellers.</b>

09:29.710 --> 09:31.050
<b>Ishikawa?</b>

09:32.190 --> 09:36.840
<b>Excuse me. I couldn't help myself
after hearing such happy-go-lucky remarks.</b>

09:36.840 --> 09:40.200
<b>You still have
the energy to talk nonsense?</b>

09:40.200 --> 09:42.850
<b>In that case,
I shall grant you salvation first.</b>

09:43.280 --> 09:44.450
<b>I see.</b>

09:44.450 --> 09:48.290
<b>Now I get why Sakurama wants to surrender.</b>

09:48.290 --> 09:50.690
<b>You guys made the right choice.</b>

09:50.690 --> 09:53.860
<b>Yukino managed to land a blow.</b>

10:04.050 --> 10:05.710
<b>Darn, it's out of energy!</b>

10:05.710 --> 10:08.210
<b>But it's too late now!</b>

10:08.210 --> 10:09.890
<b><i>No, it isn't!</i></b>

10:15.510 --> 10:17.110
<b>You little…</b>

10:21.550 --> 10:25.780
<b>Sorry to keep everyone waiting!
The hero always arrives late!</b>

10:27.850 --> 10:31.540
<b>This is better, right?
</b>

10:31.540 --> 10:36.240
<b>That is exactly how a cadet,
the archenemy of monsters, should be!</b>

10:36.240 --> 10:39.240
<b>It's the same
no matter how many more people are here!</b>

10:39.240 --> 10:40.510
<b>Everyone's Dragon Gadgets!</b>

10:40.510 --> 10:43.100
<b>You should have surrendered
without a fight.</b>

10:43.100 --> 10:45.890
<b>It was foolish to abandon your weapons!</b>

10:47.960 --> 10:51.210
<b>You'll be fine, Kurusu.
Hold the bird over your head!</b>

10:53.840 --> 10:56.360
<b>Foolish surface-dwellers!</b>

10:56.360 --> 10:57.970
<b>Throw it, Usukubo!
</b>

10:58.220 --> 11:00.180
<b>No need for weapons.</b>

11:00.400 --> 11:02.720
<b>All I need is this fist of mine!</b>

11:02.720 --> 11:06.220
<b>For the sake of a peaceful world,
bow down to me!</b>

11:06.220 --> 11:10.480
<b>No one's gonna listen to you.
We're all too busy with our own problems.</b>

11:12.950 --> 11:14.040
<b>Bleh.</b>

11:14.040 --> 11:17.990
<b>All that fancy talk won't change anything.
We'll continue to fight.</b>

11:17.990 --> 11:21.490
<b>Because there are things
we can only grasp by winning.</b>

11:21.490 --> 11:23.990
<b>Mimicry? Then where are the real ones?</b>

11:38.010 --> 11:40.300
<b>D! You betrayed--</b>

11:41.010 --> 11:43.760
<b>I don't need your help anymore.</b>

11:44.440 --> 11:49.830
<b>I wonder if I managed to act
a little more like a hero at the very end.</b>

11:51.320 --> 11:54.080
<b>Ishikawa… We did it.</b>

11:54.080 --> 11:56.110
<b>We defeated the monster.</b>

11:56.110 --> 11:57.550
<b>And it's a boss monster.</b>

11:57.550 --> 11:59.940
<b>That wouldn't just make us
official Rangers.</b>

11:59.940 --> 12:01.450
<b>We're as good as Dragon Keepers!</b>

12:01.920 --> 12:05.450
<b>We did great as the Rangers.</b>

12:05.450 --> 12:07.930
<b>What a tragic end.</b>

12:09.260 --> 12:11.060
<b><i>This isn't the end for me yet.</i></b>

12:11.890 --> 12:16.060
<b><i>My enemies are… the Dragon Keepers.</i></b>

12:16.890 --> 12:19.820
<b><i>Today's casualties caused
by monsters stand at 350 people,</i></b>

12:19.820 --> 12:21.970
<b><i>an increase from last week.</i></b>

12:21.970 --> 12:25.970
<b><i>Experts believe that the number
will continue to increase,</i></b>

12:25.970 --> 12:28.030
<b><i>and thus the authorities
are working to further--</i></b>

12:28.030 --> 12:29.950
<b>Hello.</b>

12:29.950 --> 12:31.200
<b>What's up?</b>

12:31.200 --> 12:33.960
<b><i>The cash transport vehicle
should be arriving anytime soon.</i></b>

12:33.960 --> 12:35.120
<b><i>Are you all prepared?</i></b>

12:35.120 --> 12:36.980
<b>This shit isn't worth preparing for.</b>

12:36.980 --> 12:39.420
<b>All right,
shall we get to work?</b>

12:39.420 --> 12:41.990
<b>Let's make this quick
before the cops get here.</b>

12:44.630 --> 12:45.950
<b>Good evening.</b>

12:46.380 --> 12:47.870
<b>Who are you guys?</b>

12:47.870 --> 12:49.470
<b>Those look heavy.</b>

12:50.040 --> 12:53.680
<b>Leave the heavy-lifting work to us,
and go take a nap!</b>

12:54.890 --> 12:58.060
<b>Woah, awesome!
This is a whole lot of money!</b>

12:58.060 --> 13:00.670
<b>Mr. Kamiya's tip is perfect!</b>

13:00.670 --> 13:02.360
<b>Let's follow him
for the rest of our lives!</b>

13:02.360 --> 13:03.670
<b>Yeah!
 Hey.</b>

13:04.520 --> 13:07.280
<b>You guys shouldn't fully trust
that old man--</b>

13:07.280 --> 13:08.550
<b>Wait!
</b>

13:08.550 --> 13:11.060
<b>Where the evil of this world stirs,</b>

13:11.060 --> 13:13.310
<b>you shall find us protecting justice!</b>

13:13.310 --> 13:16.620
<b>The Red Keeper of the Divine
Dragon Rangers: the Dragon Keepers</b>

13:16.620 --> 13:18.060
<b>makes his entrance!</b>

13:18.540 --> 13:21.130
<b>Let's grab those and head back quickly.
 Got it.</b>

13:21.130 --> 13:23.950
<b>This is important,
so I shall repeat myself! Wait!</b>

13:23.950 --> 13:25.300
<b>You sure we can ignore him?</b>

13:25.300 --> 13:26.450
<b>He's from the Rangers.</b>

13:26.450 --> 13:28.760
<b>The real one wouldn't bother with us.</b>

13:28.760 --> 13:31.330
<b>We don't have the time
to deal with some cosplay dude.</b>

13:32.340 --> 13:34.330
<b>Sorry, but I'm the real deal.</b>

13:34.330 --> 13:37.600
<b>You do know that stealing
someone else's money is bad, right?</b>

13:37.600 --> 13:39.840
<b>I shall judge
all the evildoings in this world!</b>

13:41.890 --> 13:46.090
<b>This is how we make a living!
As if I'll let you judge us!</b>

13:50.350 --> 13:51.600
<b>Take this!</b>

13:51.600 --> 13:53.540
<b>You have a stout build.</b>

13:53.540 --> 13:56.850
<b>It'll do the world a good deed
if someone like you joins the Rangers.</b>

13:56.850 --> 13:58.670
<b>I'm not interested in fixing this world.</b>

13:58.670 --> 14:01.610
<b>The more chaotic this world,
the better it is for scamps like us!</b>

14:04.710 --> 14:05.860
<b>Huh?</b>

14:06.580 --> 14:09.220
<b>Seriously?
Things are just getting exciting.</b>

14:11.090 --> 14:12.370
<b>Aoshima!</b>

14:12.800 --> 14:14.220
<b>Something else came up.</b>

14:14.220 --> 14:16.310
<b>You guys better not misbehave again.</b>

14:16.310 --> 14:18.390
<b>Do that again
and I'll punish you for real!</b>

14:20.810 --> 14:23.690
<b>Damn it! What's his deal?</b>

14:25.400 --> 14:27.630
<b>What's so funny?
</b>

14:28.440 --> 14:30.530
<b>Can you guess what this is?</b>

14:31.940 --> 14:34.870
<b>Cheers to you courageous youths!</b>

14:34.870 --> 14:36.640
<b>Cheers!
</b>

14:37.070 --> 14:39.500
<b>Is this really okay, Mr. Kamiya?</b>

14:39.500 --> 14:42.750
<b>I think we've definitely
crossed the line yesterday.</b>

14:42.750 --> 14:46.840
<b>Don't worry,
I've already made the perfect alibis.</b>

14:46.840 --> 14:52.050
<b>We can prove that you guys were at
a completely different place at the time.</b>

14:52.050 --> 14:56.180
<b>Wow! You're really awesome, Mr. Kamiya!
 Amazing!</b>

14:56.180 --> 15:00.350
<b><i>Red Keeper… That damn bastard.
How dare he act like he's justice!</i></b>

15:00.350 --> 15:04.610
<b>Woah! Playing games by yourself, Shougo?
That's so sad.</b>

15:04.610 --> 15:08.740
<b>Wakaba. Didn't you
quit this place for a daytime job?</b>

15:08.740 --> 15:10.660
<b>I did, but the company
went out of business</b>

15:10.660 --> 15:14.180
<b>because of monster-related problems,
so I'm back here.</b>

15:14.180 --> 15:15.560
<b>There are many others like me.</b>

15:17.430 --> 15:18.960
<b>Come drink, Aoshima!</b>

15:18.960 --> 15:21.460
<b>It wouldn't be surprising
if the world were to end tomorrow,</b>

15:21.460 --> 15:23.460
<b>so let's use up all our fortune!</b>

15:24.250 --> 15:25.670
<b>I'm going home.
Huh? What?</b>

15:25.670 --> 15:27.610
<b>Come on! Are you serious?</b>

15:27.610 --> 15:28.840
<b><i>What's wrong with him?</i></b>

15:28.840 --> 15:30.930
<b><i>Don't worry about it.
It happens all the time.</i></b>

15:30.930 --> 15:33.620
<b><i>Apparently, saving money is his hobby.</i></b>

15:34.050 --> 15:36.620
<b>Sorry to make you do this
all the time, Shougo.</b>

15:36.620 --> 15:38.390
<b>This is more than the usual amount.</b>

15:38.390 --> 15:40.370
<b>Should I not ask where you got them from?</b>

15:40.370 --> 15:43.810
<b>Yeah. If I tell you, you'll transform.</b>

15:43.810 --> 15:46.520
<b>I've had enough
of dealing with Dragon Keepers.</b>

15:49.730 --> 15:50.900
<b>Damn brat!</b>

15:50.900 --> 15:54.570
<b>I don't even need to transform
to deal with an amateur like you!</b>

15:54.570 --> 15:57.180
<b>Don't look down on this Blue Keeper!</b>

15:57.180 --> 16:00.290
<b><i>I'm not here
as the Blue Keeper of the Rangers.</i></b>

16:00.290 --> 16:03.190
<b><i>I'm managing this facility
in my personal capacity.</i></b>

16:03.190 --> 16:06.960
<b><i>In these times, children with no one
to turn to will only increase.</i></b>

16:06.960 --> 16:11.200
<b><i>As Blue, I have to deal with the monsters,
the root of all this.</i></b>

16:11.200 --> 16:15.090
<b>So, I'll turn a blind eye to any mischief
caused by our facility graduates.</b>

16:15.090 --> 16:18.200
<b>Hah! Hard to believe
that you're an ally of justice.</b>

16:18.630 --> 16:21.560
<b>I'm no ally of justice.</b>

16:21.560 --> 16:25.640
<b>I simply want to side
with the kids living here.</b>

16:26.560 --> 16:30.800
<b>Even someone like you
is a hero to these kids.</b>

16:30.800 --> 16:34.640
<b>Um, big brother. Thank you for all you do.</b>

16:36.640 --> 16:38.070
<b>Don't be dumb.</b>

16:39.240 --> 16:42.270
<b>I can no longer walk on
the sunny side of the street.</b>

16:42.950 --> 16:45.500
<b>I'm just a scumbag who will probably
die in a ditch somewhere.</b>

16:46.150 --> 16:48.250
<b><i>No point playing dumb now.</i></b>

16:48.250 --> 16:50.650
<b><i>We received a report
from the Ranger Force Headquarters.</i></b>

16:50.650 --> 16:52.010
<b><i>Damn you!</i></b>

16:52.010 --> 16:54.930
<b><i>Fine, but I'm the only one you identified.</i></b>

16:54.930 --> 16:57.660
<b><i>You don't have proof to show
that those guys were at the same place!</i></b>

16:57.660 --> 16:58.850
<b><i>That's right.</i></b>

16:58.850 --> 17:01.520
<b><i>Those guys are suspected
of robbery, murder,</i></b>

17:01.520 --> 17:04.520
<b><i>and abandonment of a corpse that occurred
at another place at the same time.</i></b>

17:04.520 --> 17:05.670
<b>Kamiya!</b>

17:05.670 --> 17:08.110
<b><i>The fingerprints and shoeprints
left on the crime scene</i></b>

17:08.110 --> 17:09.440
<b><i>are a perfect match to theirs.</i></b>

17:09.850 --> 17:11.360
<b>That was unfortunate.</b>

17:11.360 --> 17:14.030
<b>But you managed to earn some,
so it's all good.</b>

17:14.030 --> 17:17.320
<b>Screw you. Why did you set them up?
</b>

17:17.320 --> 17:20.030
<b>It's common sense to throw away
the small fries once they're useless.</b>

17:20.030 --> 17:22.040
<b>After all,
idiots tend to say unnecessary things</b>

17:22.040 --> 17:23.250
<b>if they get carried away.</b>

17:23.250 --> 17:25.690
<b>Damn you. You planned
to do this from the very start!</b>

17:25.690 --> 17:28.210
<b>I see some promise only in you,</b>

17:28.210 --> 17:31.300
<b>so I made sure that you'll get out
after five years or so.</b>

17:31.300 --> 17:33.190
<b>Let's work together again.</b>

17:33.190 --> 17:35.110
<b>Screw you!</b>

17:36.840 --> 17:39.200
<b>Not very obedient, are you?</b>

17:39.200 --> 17:42.390
<b>Don't surface-dwellers have a rule
saying that you get punished</b>

17:42.390 --> 17:45.510
<b>if you do something bad?</b>

17:51.420 --> 17:53.920
<b>Be a good boy and follow the rule!</b>

17:54.900 --> 17:56.820
<b><i>Damn… it…</i></b>

18:00.150 --> 18:02.740
<b>Am I… still alive?</b>

18:02.740 --> 18:04.100
<b>I see you're awake.</b>

18:05.390 --> 18:08.040
<b>That voice… You're Red Keeper!</b>

18:08.040 --> 18:11.480
<b>Quiet down.
Things are just getting exciting.</b>

18:11.480 --> 18:14.090
<b><i>Because I have to protect
my precious allies!</i></b>

18:14.090 --> 18:17.490
<b><i>Humans become stronger
when we fight for someone's sake!</i></b>

18:17.490 --> 18:20.490
<b><i>Unlike you monsters who go on a rampage
for your own satisfaction!</i></b>

18:21.870 --> 18:23.720
<b>Good things never grow old.</b>

18:24.550 --> 18:26.890
<b>Sorry to keep you waiting, Shougo Aoshima.</b>

18:26.890 --> 18:29.130
<b>Seems like you were having some trouble.</b>

18:29.130 --> 18:31.980
<b>Shut up! Everything turned into a mess
because you butted in…</b>

18:31.980 --> 18:34.980
<b>Calm down, now.
Still acting like a mad dog, aren't you?</b>

18:36.630 --> 18:40.240
<b>Many citizens fall into traps
set by monsters, just like you.</b>

18:41.070 --> 18:45.060
<b>I guess a chaotic world
is inconvenient for scamps too.</b>

18:45.060 --> 18:47.290
<b>Damn it!
Just throw me into a cell already!</b>

18:47.290 --> 18:48.960
<b>Calm down.</b>

18:48.960 --> 18:51.290
<b>You have two choices.</b>

18:51.290 --> 18:52.960
<b>Either you take the path of the villain,</b>

18:52.960 --> 18:55.500
<b>where you'll accept your punishment
in a dark and confined room,</b>

18:55.500 --> 18:57.670
<b>or you take the path
of the righteous hero,</b>

18:57.670 --> 19:01.010
<b>where you'll punish the monster
who tricked you with your own hands.</b>

19:01.010 --> 19:03.260
<b>You're asking me
to join the Rangers again?</b>

19:03.260 --> 19:04.510
<b>What a load of crap.</b>

19:04.510 --> 19:08.640
<b>You're half-right, but you have
the potential to aim even higher.</b>

19:09.080 --> 19:10.190
<b>Truth be told,</b>

19:10.190 --> 19:13.090
<b>Blue Keeper was gravely injured
while you were asleep.</b>

19:13.090 --> 19:15.270
<b>That one's a goner.</b>

19:15.270 --> 19:16.650
<b>I can't use him anymore.</b>

19:16.650 --> 19:19.090
<b>You're lying. No way!</b>

19:19.090 --> 19:21.440
<b>Can you forgive that dastardly monster?</b>

19:22.020 --> 19:23.240
<b>You wish to avenge your allies</b>

19:23.240 --> 19:25.060
<b>and the person
who took care of you, right?</b>

19:27.110 --> 19:31.400
<b>The power of the Dragon Gods
will grant your wish!</b>

19:31.400 --> 19:35.530
<b>Shougo Aoshima.
You are the new Blue Keeper!</b>

19:37.400 --> 19:39.880
<b><i>I don't need allies anymore.</i></b>

19:39.880 --> 19:41.880
<b><i>If I were to be alone
from the very beginning,</i></b>

19:41.880 --> 19:43.910
<b><i>then I wouldn't feel lonely.</i></b>

19:46.170 --> 19:48.510
<b>Damn it… There's too many of them!</b>

19:51.420 --> 19:53.420
<b>Blue Keeper!</b>

19:56.140 --> 19:57.920
<b>Konno!</b>

19:59.520 --> 20:00.690
<b>Konno!</b>

20:01.690 --> 20:03.090
<b>You're safe…</b>

20:03.090 --> 20:07.100
<b>T-Take this… It's my cartridge.</b>

20:07.100 --> 20:08.240
<b>Konno!</b>

20:09.600 --> 20:12.460
<b><i>Isn't this the same as before?</i></b>

20:12.460 --> 20:14.940
<b><i>Because of my incompetence, my allies are…</i></b>

20:14.940 --> 20:18.210
<b><i>No, I won't make the same mistake!</i></b>

20:18.210 --> 20:19.610
<b><i>I will protect him!</i></b>

20:19.610 --> 20:21.630
<b>We got interrupted.</b>

20:21.630 --> 20:23.720
<b>There's no need to be sad.</b>

20:23.720 --> 20:27.120
<b>Soon, you and your subordinate
will be headed to a quiet world.</b>

20:27.120 --> 20:30.290
<b>Divine Artifact, Manifest! Hiruko!</b>

20:42.610 --> 20:44.300
<b>Th-This is…</b>

20:53.740 --> 20:55.060
<b>Breathing…</b>

20:55.490 --> 20:57.420
<b>It's a biological mechanism
you have to use</b>

20:57.420 --> 21:00.000
<b>as long as you're living on the surface.</b>

21:00.000 --> 21:03.570
<b>Boss monster, you're not becoming a god.</b>

21:04.210 --> 21:07.090
<b>I avenged you, Aizome.</b>

21:08.960 --> 21:10.950
<b>I'm not dead yet!
</b>

21:12.960 --> 21:14.690
<b>Huh…
</b>

21:14.690 --> 21:17.960
<b>Junior First Rank Aizome… I'm so glad!
I thought you were going to die for real!</b>

21:17.960 --> 21:20.650
<b>I'm sorry that I couldn't
rush over to you immediately!</b>

21:20.650 --> 21:22.720
<b>No, it's okay.</b>

21:22.720 --> 21:26.720
<b>After all,
the most trustworthy hero came for me.</b>

21:26.720 --> 21:30.470
<b>Your wound is shallow.
Thanks, Konno.</b>

21:31.030 --> 21:33.390
<b>Don't you die
over something dumb like this!</b>

21:39.360 --> 21:41.940
<b>Woah, they're all dead!</b>

21:41.940 --> 21:44.860
<b>You did this all alone? What a freak!</b>

21:45.420 --> 21:46.910
<b>That voice…</b>

21:46.910 --> 21:49.910
<b>But there is still an enemy left.</b>

21:52.430 --> 21:54.750
<b>A monster is right here.</b>

21:54.750 --> 21:57.500
<b>Monsters or the Dragon Keepers…</b>

21:57.500 --> 22:01.500
<b>Time to settle
which one of us will rule the world!</b>

23:29.310 --> 23:31.470
<b>Translated by Qianni Lu</b>

23:32.110 --> 23:34.600
<b>Divine Artifact, Manifest!</b>

23:34.600 --> 23:36.450
<b>Time to settle
which one of us will rule the world!</b>

23:36.450 --> 23:38.870
<b>Fighter-kun, it's finally the climax!</b>

23:38.870 --> 23:41.080
<b>Wow! I'm excited
to find out who's going to win!</b>

23:41.080 --> 23:42.610
<b>You guys talk
like it's none of your business!</b>

23:42.610 --> 23:44.400
<b><i>Next episode,
"Never Stop, Fighter D!"</i></b>

23:44.400 --> 23:46.480
<b>Blue Keeper!
Let me say it!</b>
